Third-Party Dependencies:

None are redistributed in this repository. Everything below is fetched from
its own source by setup/setup_yolov4_on_ttmetal.sh, or referenced only.

tt-metal and TTNN
    https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal
    Apache License 2.0.
    The scripts in setup/patches/ modify files from this project in place on
    the user's own machine. No tt-metal source is redistributed here.

YOLOv4 model implementation in TTNN
    https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/tree/3a0e3987db56711450ec04d388dadcd723d80c98/models/demos/yolov4
    Apache License 2.0, part of tt-metal.
    Fetched at the commit named above.

YOLOv4 pretrained weights (yolov4.pth)
    A public download, fetched by the model's own script during setup.
    YOLOv4 originates from the Darknet line of work and is not an
    Ultralytics model.

COCO class names
    https://cocodataset.org
    The detector predicts 80 categories whose names come from the COCO dataset.
    The list of names ships with the detector in tt-metal. The dataset itself is
    not redistributed here.

